# Line-ending policy.
#
# Text files are stored as LF in the repository and checked out as CRLF
# (native Windows line endings) in working copies, since this project is
# developed on Windows. This makes line endings deterministic for everyone
# and silences Git's "LF will be replaced by CRLF" hints.

* text=auto eol=crlf

# Keep binary assets out of text normalization entirely.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.apk binary
*.keystore binary